{"id":1130301,"name":"菫・取り調べⅠ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"菫・取り調べⅠ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1130301]}],"trial":{"trial_id":130301,"stage":"段階1","unlock_time":"","diary1":"過去一年間、FAC関係者の「事故死」率が異常に高くなっている。そのことにはある殺し屋組織が関わっているという情報がある。現在FACが掴んでいる情報は少なく、組織の名前が「花庭園」であること、そして近頃収容されたニューシティの華道家——菫が関与していることしか知らない。花庭園の情報を手に入れるために、FACはMBCCに専門調査員を送った。","diary2":"FACの専門調査員が心不全で亡くなった。これが花庭園の仕業ではないかとFACは疑っているが、証拠がない。あなたが裏で手を回したおかげで、FACがこれ以上菫を困らせることはなかった。手元の仕事を片づけたら、もう一度彼女を取り調べるとしよう。","evidence":[{"ID":260086,"Num":1},{"ID":260088,"Num":1},{"ID":260090,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260087,"Num":1},{"ID":260089,"Num":1},{"ID":260091,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":16,"dialogue_id":230301001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":1,"dialogue_id":230301004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":7,"dialogue_id":230301005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":3,"dialogue_id":230301008,"next":[9]},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":6,"dialogue_id":1,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230301021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,